# Editor accessibility

Interactive editor UI must meet WCAG AA.

- Give every icon-only control an accessible name.
- Expose the selected tool with `aria-pressed` or `aria-selected`.
- Move focus into a dialog and return it on close. Escape closes the dialog.
- Provide a keyboard path for every pointer action.
- Keep a visible focus indicator.
- Decorative SVG icons use `aria-hidden="true"`. An icon that is the control's only label does not.

```html
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<button (click)="choose('pen')"><svg>...</svg></button>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<button type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Pen" (click)="choose('pen')">
  <svg aria-hidden="true">...</svg>
</button>
```
